            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border/80 bg-background/70 p-3">
              <div class="h-10 rounded-xl bg-accent"></div>
              <p class="mt-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-2">Accent</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-foreground">#d8a665</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid gap-6 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.95fr)_minmax(0,1.05fr)]">
          <div class="ds-direction-surface rounded-[1.75rem] p-4">
            <p class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted-2">Library shelf</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Series presented like a curated collection.</h3>
            <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
              <% [ "Frieren", "Monster", "Vagabond" ].each do |title| %>
                <div class="space-y-3">
                  <div class="ds-direction-cover aspect-[2/3] rounded-[1.5rem]"></div>
                  <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground"><%= title %></p>
                    <p class="text-xs text-muted-2">Author, status, and shelf context stay readable without noise.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              <% end %>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="ds-direction-shell grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)]">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 p-4">
              <div class="ds-direction-surface rounded-[1.5rem] p-5">
                <p class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted-2">Series detail</p>
                <div class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row">
                  <div class="ds-direction-cover aspect-[2/3] w-40 rounded-[1.5rem]"></div>
                  <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">The Climber</h3>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                      <span class="ds-direction-pill rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-xs">Drama</span>
                      <span class="ds-direction-pill rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-xs">Psychological</span>
                      <span class="ds-direction-pill rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-xs">Completed</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="max-w-lg text-sm text-muted">
                      Synopsis, creator names, and collection metadata feel like a printed sleeve note instead of a status
                      dump.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
                <div class="ds-direction-metric rounded-2xl p-4">
                  <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-2">Curated reads</p>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">12</p>
                </div>
                <div class="ds-direction-metric rounded-2xl p-4">
                  <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-2">Series finished</p>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">48</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="ds-direction-surface rounded-[1.5rem] p-4">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
                  <div>
                    <p class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted-2">Reader feel</p>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Still calm, but with warmer paper tones and softer chrome.</p>
                  </div>
                  <span class="rounded-full border border-border/80 bg-background/70 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted">Best for collection</span>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
                  <div class="ds-direction-page h-56 rounded-[1.4rem]"></div>
                  <div class="ds-direction-page h-56 rounded-[1.4rem]"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </details>

    <article id="panel-pulse" data-direction="panel-pulse" class="ds-direction-card rounded-[2rem] p-4 sm:p-6">
      <div class="relative space-y-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 xl:flex-row xl:items-start xl:justify-between">
          <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
            <span class="ds-direction-label"><%= icon "sparkles", class: "size-3.5" %> Panel Pulse</span>
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-foreground">A sharper, manga-tech direction with more momentum in browse and status-heavy UI.</h2>
                <span class="rounded-full border border-accent/30 bg-accent-soft px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent-foreground/90">
                  Legacy theme
                </span>
              </div>
              <p class="max-w-2xl text-sm text-muted">
                This version is the most expressive. It leans into electric cyan accents, graphic framing, and a more
                animated sense of system state, without becoming a neon cyberpunk cliché.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
              <span class="ds-direction-pill rounded-full px-3 py-1.5">High-energy browse</span>
